{"body": [{"y0": 67.8, "x0": 149.9, "x1": 202.4, "text": "PENSVM B"}, {"y0": 79.8, "x0": 150.0, "x1": 404.7, "text": "Iànua cónstat é duàbus —, quae in — vertuntur. Ostiàrius vel"}, {"y0": 95.1, "x0": 149.3, "x1": 404.7, "text": "— dicitur servus qui homines in villam —. Canis eius prope"}, {"y0": 109.4, "x0": 149.9, "x1": 405.3, "text": "tam — quam lupus est; itaque necesse est eum caténà —"}, {"y0": 121.8, "x0": 150.4, "x1": 404.7, "text": "[«ferrum] —. Anulus Lydiae nón ex ferró, sed ex — factus"}, {"y0": 137.3, "x0": 149.5, "x1": 404.9, "text": "est. Servus qui epistulas fert — dicitur, nam — epistulae in"}, {"y0": 151.3, "x0": 149.7, "x1": 237.0, "text": "tabellis scribebantur."}, {"y0": 165.0, "x0": 159.4, "x1": 404.7, "text": "Tabellarius — ianuam stat. lànitor, qui — ianuam sedet,"}, {"y0": 178.7, "x0": 149.7, "x1": 404.9, "text": "tabellarium dé cane feróci —: *Cavé! Canis té —!\" In soló"}, {"y0": 192.7, "x0": 149.7, "x1": 405.3, "text": "intrà — scriptum est '— canem' infrà — canis. ^Nec haec —"}, {"y0": 206.9, "x0": 149.7, "x1": 404.7, "text": "nec canis vérus mé —\" inquit tabellarius, ac propius ad ca-"}, {"y0": 221.0, "x0": 149.7, "x1": 404.7, "text": "nem —-.. Canis caténam — et vestem eius dentibus —. Tabel-"}, {"y0": 234.6, "x0": 149.7, "x1": 404.9, "text": "larius neque — neque — audet. Iànitor: ^— prócedis? Ego te"}, {"y0": 248.5, "x0": 149.5, "x1": 404.9, "text": "intráre —!\" Sic iànitor hominem territum —. Ille alterum"}, {"y0": 262.4, "x0": 149.7, "x1": 404.9, "text": "gradum facit, sed canis eum ex ostio —. Tlépolemus tótó"}, {"y0": 276.4, "x0": 149.7, "x1": 402.4, "text": "corpore — ex ostio —. — [2 postremo] ianitor canem vincit."}, {"y0": 304.5, "x0": 149.7, "x1": 202.4, "text": "PENSVM C"}, {"y0": 318.3, "x0": 149.9, "x1": 266.0, "text": "Quid est iànitóris officium?"}, {"y0": 332.0, "x0": 149.7, "x1": 301.4, "text": "Cür necesse est canem eius vincire?"}, {"y0": 345.9, "x0": 149.9, "x1": 277.5, "text": "Ex quà màterià cónstat iànua?"}, {"y0": 360.1, "x0": 149.5, "x1": 228.0, "text": "Vulcànus quis est?"}, {"y0": 374.1, "x0": 149.9, "x1": 290.4, "text": "Quid in soló intrà limen videtur?"}, {"y0": 388.0, "x0": 149.9, "x1": 269.7, "text": "Quid tabellàrius sécum fert?"}, {"y0": 401.9, "x0": 149.9, "x1": 325.0, "text": "Unde venit Tlepolemus et quem quaerit?"}, {"y0": 415.5, "x0": 149.9, "x1": 305.2, "text": "Quomodo iànitor é somno excitatur?"}, {"y0": 429.8, "x0": 149.9, "x1": 286.1, "text": "Quid agit Iülius post meridiem?"}, {"y0": 443.6, "x0": 149.5, "x1": 314.2, "text": "Cür canis saliens caténà nón retinétur?"}, {"y0": 457.8, "x0": 149.7, "x1": 345.0, "text": "Quid facit iànitor antequam tabellarius intrat?"}], "margin": [{"y0": 68.0, "x0": 48.5, "x1": 66.7, "text": "feróx"}, {"y0": 77.0, "x0": 48.5, "x1": 73.4, "text": "ferreus"}, {"y0": 88.1, "x0": 48.7, "x1": 71.9, "text": "aureus"}, {"y0": 95.3, "x0": 48.5, "x1": 73.7, "text": "ligneus"}, {"y0": 104.3, "x0": 48.4, "x1": 81.1, "text": "cüstodire"}, {"y0": 113.5, "x0": 48.4, "x1": 82.4, "text": "admittere"}, {"y0": 122.7, "x0": 48.4, "x1": 72.7, "text": "vincire"}, {"y0": 132.4, "x0": 48.5, "x1": 75.9, "text": "rogitare"}, {"y0": 141.0, "x0": 48.5, "x1": 75.9, "text": "fremere"}, {"y0": 150.2, "x0": 48.5, "x1": 78.4, "text": "mordere"}, {"y0": 159.2, "x0": 48.5, "x1": 75.9, "text": "retinere"}, {"y0": 168.9, "x0": 48.4, "x1": 70.9, "text": "cavére"}, {"y0": 177.9, "x0": 48.4, "x1": 75.2, "text": "monére"}, {"y0": 186.4, "x0": 48.5, "x1": 77.7, "text": "resistere"}, {"y0": 195.6, "x0": 48.5, "x1": 73.2, "text": "solvere"}, {"y0": 205.7, "x0": 48.5, "x1": 71.9, "text": "terrére"}, {"y0": 214.1, "x0": 48.4, "x1": 78.8, "text": "accedere"}, {"y0": 223.3, "x0": 48.7, "x1": 67.3, "text": "salire"}, {"y0": 234.1, "x0": 48.5, "x1": 79.1, "text": "rumpere"}, {"y0": 241.3, "x0": 48.7, "x1": 71.6, "text": "cedere"}, {"y0": 250.3, "x0": 48.7, "x1": 88.9, "text": "prehendere"}, {"y0": 259.5, "x0": 48.7, "x1": 78.6, "text": "recedere"}, {"y0": 268.7, "x0"